Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:09.04,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,600)\shad3\blur1\fs60\c&HF1F1F1&}Episode 20 \N {\fs100} Story of Demons {鬼の話の巻}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.23,0:00:16.61,Narrator,,0,0,0,,On the rocky mountain, a demon tribe \Nwelcomes the first day of spring.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.88,0:00:22.20,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Oh... It's their smoke signal! {beacon; skyrocket; signal fire; smoke signals}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.26,0:00:31.45,Song,,0,0,0,,The last day of winter is upon us! \NThe day we've all been waiting for. {setsubun; last day of winter in the traditional Japanese calendar (usu. February 3 or 4) on which a bean scattering ceremony is held}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.52,0:00:37.52,Song,,0,0,0,,Go for it, that's the way, \Nfeast at a woman's indulgence. {??????????????????????????? nc what's that hoshitsu, but the next line suggests at this}{女の放逸が食べられる; think it's just them telling you to have sex}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.52,0:00:43.76,Song,,0,0,0,,No way we lose to some bean flickers, \Nso go for it, you can do it! {lit: can't lose to some beans - bean is "female genitalia (esp. the clitoris)" so I guess it really is what I think it is, though maybe not so explicit in japanese}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.76,0:00:49.01,Song,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.01,0:00:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.54,0:00:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take a short break, men!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.70,0:00:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it weird?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.69,0:00:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.14,0:01:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Down this road, there's the Hermit Village, \Nfamous for it's exquisite beauties... {??????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.30,0:01:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.10,0:01:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right... I see now.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.02,0:01:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's what they say. {??????}{"Well, that's what I've heard at least"}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.33,0:01:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you get a medal for this!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.18,0:01:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.94,0:01:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A medal for me?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.38,0:01:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Imbecile!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.55,0:01:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.70,0:01:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't come to the village looking like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.84,0:01:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll stop for the night \Nat that cave over there, see? {???????}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.02,0:01:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You there, Saeki and Amanojaku! {amanojaku is "antagonistic demon in Japanese folklore" but saeki seems to be just a normal name; don't think this needs a tl note unless I can explain saeki as well}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.80,0:01:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.70,0:01:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think something is missing?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.70,0:01:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely, sir. Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.81,0:02:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you know, then you go out there \Nand bring them here at once!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.36,0:02:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A young and piping-hot girl for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.03,0:02:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly, but with this guy I can't... {?????}{talking about the other guy (idk who's Saeki and who's Amanojaku here)}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.70,0:02:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What was that? \NWon't you repeat what you just said for me?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.41,0:02:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you still babbling around here?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.43,0:02:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Go out there at once and capture one for me!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.29,0:02:21.90,Narrator,,0,0,0,,At the Hermit Village,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.90,0:02:25.81,Narrator,,0,0,0,,the nymphs were also preparing \Nfor the first day of spring by planting beans.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.81,0:02:28.11,Narrator,,0,0,0,,You may ask, \N"But isn't it too late to do that now?"
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.11,0:02:31.85,Narrator,,0,0,0,,No, not if you do that at the Hermit Village.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.79,0:02:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't hurry up, we won't make it in time for the end of winter. {Setsubun was already translated as the last of winter}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.66,0:02:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like this one is not quite enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.06,0:02:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose. Then I'll go plant another one now.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.72,0:03:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see those two? \NYou go after that younger one.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.29,0:03:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! I hate that kind of immature attitude. {???????????? no clue what he means by "smell of piss"}{it means she smells of piss instead of smelling like a woman (pheromones and such). That reminds me of a guy I knew on Discord who got his little niece's underwear and smelled them, he said they just smelled of piss; he then compared them to the time he smelled his older cousin's underwear, he said they smelled "like a woman" and that's the one he got hard with (rubes smh)}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.10,0:03:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you prefer the older one, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.80,0:03:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I prefer them young. {based}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.22,0:03:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There, hurry up and grow big and strong.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.28,0:03:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Interesting! \NThe shoot sprouted already.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.71,0:03:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That sure was fast...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.30,0:03:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive wizardry. \NShe could be a problem.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.30,0:03:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this might call for one of my treasures... {?????????????}{虎の子}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.95,0:04:02.65,Narrator,,0,0,0,,It's a 10,000 yen towel. {??? I guess it means "bathing towel made out of a 10000 yen note"?}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.65,0:04:04.84,Narrator,,0,0,0,,What is he going to do with it?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.29,0:04:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.83,0:04:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my "Unbeatable Money Binding Technique." {??? nc what's fudou here; https://jisho.org/word/%E9%87%91%E7%B8%9B%E3%82%8A}{unbeatable}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.85,0:04:26.96,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Ah, that makes sense...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.77,0:04:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's how you do it! \NIn the end, this is the best way to deal with women. {??????????}{money and women}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.19,0:04:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's ripe for harvesting already. {?????}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.91,0:04:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.70,0:05:00.01,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Oh... Are his tonsils perhaps inflamed? {??????? dentousen is "electrical light wiring"}{扁桃腺}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.01,0:05:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.00,0:05:06.00,Song,,0,0,0,,O maiden, hear me...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.00,0:05:10.19,Song,,0,0,0,,With your dark hair,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.19,0:05:14.22,Song,,0,0,0,,you make my heart flutter... {??????????????????????????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.03,0:05:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No! It tickles!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.22,0:05:18.57,Song,,0,0,0,,Deep in my eyes,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.27,0:05:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No... It tickles!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.57,0:05:22.66,Song,,0,0,0,,you're burning a hole right through them. {his eyes}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.66,0:05:30.79,Song,,0,0,0,,With thin white fingers, \Nyou twine the threads of my heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.28,0:05:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.79,0:05:39.32,Song,,0,0,0,,Just take it, don't play with it, o maiden.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.32,0:05:47.60,Song,,0,0,0,,Now, in this flesh of mine, you left a gaping hole. {??????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.60,0:05:55.51,Song,,0,0,0,,With hot tears, I have to quench my thirst.{?????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.51,0:06:01.74,Song,,0,0,0,,O maiden...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.49,0:06:21.64,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.62,0:06:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.17,0:06:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.73,0:06:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.79,0:07:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.28,0:07:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn well done, Saeki and Amanojaku.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.15,0:07:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.48,0:07:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.24,0:07:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, your just desserts. {/medals for you}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.61,0:07:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.28,0:07:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what do we have here?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.63,0:07:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I'm scared!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.99,0:07:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not scary at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.47,0:07:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Come over here, babe.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.71,0:07:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.79,0:07:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, no need to make a fuss.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.58,0:07:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.36,0:07:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, sister!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.69,0:07:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.95,0:07:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad! This is bad! \NVery bad! People!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.90,0:07:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad! Very bad!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.63,0:07:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait here, I'll rescue them in no time.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.49,0:08:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's good! \NCome on, give it your all! Go all out!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.13,0:08:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Become fine maidens and cook those demons! {assuming she's talking to the beans?}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.01,0:08:48.33,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. So demon hunting\Ncan be like this? {鬼退治}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.70,0:09:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! I just saw something interesting! {/there's a good thing}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.00,0:09:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our chance, hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.85,0:09:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look! They're all mine now!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.62,0:09:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands off, guys! {??????} {みんなよこせ}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.80,0:09:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all mine, and only mine!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.57,0:09:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we're safe now, \Nyou can go back to being beans.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.59,0:09:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.86,0:09:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.78,0:09:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.51,0:09:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Beans?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.66,0:09:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? They're sprouting already.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.36,0:09:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So they were just beans?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.10,0:09:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Beans!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.09,0:10:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{a lot of mame da}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.46,0:10:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're beans!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.92,0:10:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Beans everywhere!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.30,0:10:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They got away while I was distracted...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.52,0:10:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no choice, \Nwe'll have to go down to the mortal realm.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.13,0:10:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe that has something good \Nin store for us, at least.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.28,0:10:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, big sister, let's do another round \Nto ensure the demons never come back.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.36,0:10:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the demons out!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.41,0:11:14.64,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The delicate flower's blossom, \Nthe demons wither. {??????????}{柔肌の花綻びて、鬼錆びに}
